# BMW 3 Series G20 four-door saloon, 2019-.
#
# The seventh 3-series, on the CLAR platform: the saloon that replaced the F30
# in 2019 and was facelifted in July 2022.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_3_Series_(G20)
#
# Dimensions 4.709 x 1.827 x 1.442 m, wheelbase 2.851 m, standard-wheelbase G20
# saloon, from the English Wikipedia dimension box. The Chinese long-wheelbase
# G28 is not modelled. Mirrors take the modelled width to 2.125 m.
#
# Colours: from the BMW UK 3 Series Saloon and Touring price list, July 2019,
# printed pages 25-26, a primary UK source:
#   Alpine White            300
#   Black Sapphire meta.    475
#   Mineralgrau metallic    A14
#   Mediterranean Blue      C10
# The price list establishes these as UK choices in July 2019, not across the
# whole 2019- run; introduction and withdrawal years are not established.
# Jet Black is also on that list but is restricted to SE and Sport trims, so it
# is left out. Brooklyn Grey and the Individual colours need dated UK evidence
# and are left out.
# Weights black 3, grey 3, white 2, blue 2, total 10, provisional pending the
# central rebase.
#
# Speed 250 km/h, the electronic limiter that applies to the whole range, the
# same figure the F30 and F10 carry. Comfort 135/385, on the line
# 180 + 1.5 x 135, equal to the F30. Classes 2,3.
#
# Dates are road presence: March 2019 intro, retires staggered 2034-2037 on a
# fifteen- to eighteen-year tail, so every colourway is still current in 2026.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-g20.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/bmw-g20.dae (47 objects). References:
# citycars/references/bmw-g20/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted low-poly deviations, recorded rather than corrected: the bumper and
# shoulder surfaces are more angular than the photographs and the glasshouse is
# simplified. At 128 px the proportions, the L-shaped tail lamps and the boot
# read correctly.

obj=citycar
name=BMW3G20(Alpinweiss)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=2
intro_year=2019
intro_month=3
retire_year=2035
retire_month=6
speed=250
class=2,3
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=135
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=385

